{"id":"n61310-2-7","stage":3,"title":"돌보다 · 照料","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61310-2-7-1","ko":"집에 부모님은 안 계신가 봐?","zh":"家里好像没有父母在吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부모님은","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계신가","meaning":"(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61346","senseId":"2","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐?","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"61346","definition":"(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2eb340e02b21f01c5f41.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61310-2-7-2","ko":"우리 부모님은 맞벌이를 하셔서 할머니가 살림을 돌봐 주셔.","zh":"我们的父母都要工作，所以是奶奶帮忙料理家务。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부모님은","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맞벌이를","meaning":"双职工","explanation":"맞벌이：双职工；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"맞벌이","audio":"/audio/8273e192427473878c8b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52414","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞벌이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하셔서","meaning":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","explanation":"하다：表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할머니가","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살림을","meaning":"生活，日子，持家","explanation":"살림：生活，日子，持家；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"살림","audio":"/audio/d59b15e8c0a310391aac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15677","senseId":"1","lemma":"살림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌봐","meaning":"照料，料理，照应","explanation":"돌보다：照料，料理，照应；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"돌보다","audio":"/audio/bb6524970702f93b5ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61310","senseId":"2","lemma":"돌보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주셔.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"8273e19242747387","term":"맞벌이","zh":"双职工","audio":"/audio/8273e192427473878c8b.mp3","entryId":"52414","definition":"夫妻两个人都工作，共同赚钱；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["맏뻐리"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"d59b15e8c0a31039","term":"살림","zh":"生活，日子，持家","audio":"/audio/d59b15e8c0a310391aac.mp3","entryId":"15677","definition":"组成一个家庭并过下去的事。","pronunciation":["살림"]},{"id":"bb6524970702f93b","term":"돌보다","zh":"照料，料理，照应","audio":"/audio/bb6524970702f93b5ae2.mp3","entryId":"61310","definition":"对某事关心并管理。","pronunciation":["돌ː보다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/26ea554745b1db22f819.mp3","speakerIndex":